y  before and they were still  saved thankfully the 12 pro has 6 gigs  of ram instead of the iphone 11 pros  4 gigs so i'm happy to let you know that  i didn't notice this happen  even once in the last week hopefully  apple will keep ios 14  updates well optimized so it stays this  way now let's touch on speakers  apple didn't mention them but there's  definitely a noticeable difference  take a listen for yourself  [Music]  is  [Music]  i found that the mids and bass are a  little bit more rich but would i notice  that if i wasn't comparing them side by  side  no what i would notice though is the  high frequencies which are louder and  more crisp  because of this the speakers peak two  decibels louder and i  love that at least most of the time most  music and videos  sound great but every once in a while  certain songs and voices  make it sound too sharp with that said i  would gladly take the trade off for  better sounding  louder speakers 95 of the time and  finally  on to the cameras overall it's a decent  update but i thought it would be bigger  now don't get me wrong  there's some instances where the  difference is massive but other times  the 12 pro is the same  or maybe even worse now if i covered all  of these in this video it would be more  than twice as long  so if you want to see every little  difference click right over there to  watch my ultimate camera comparison  against the 11 pro  and even the 10s max click above if you  guys want to subscribe so you guys don't  miss out more videos like this one  and if you haven't seen it yet check out  vadim's review as well  this has been max and i will see you in  the next video  [Music]

